# Live Demo

<BridgeSetup locale="en" />

<WVSTRackDemo locale="en" />

The rack is a real integration surface. It does not simulate plugin processing. The page tries to connect to the local Bridge automatically; use Connect to retry after changing the endpoint or token.

Read the [Demo Guide](/docs/demo-guide) for browser prerequisites and lifecycle details.
